<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Five capsule bars at irregular heights: a noise waveform, not a tidy EQ curve.
  Five chunky bars rather than seven thin ones — an adaptive icon only shows its
  inner 72dp, so a 6dp bar comes out around two pixels wide in a launcher grid and
  disappears. Everything stays inside a 36dp radius of the 108dp centre so a
  circular mask cannot clip it. White only; LightOS is a greyscale panel.
-->
